        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Cancer &mdash; 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p><em>Demonic Blue Flames &mdash; cold fire that burns by feeding on souls.</em></p><p>Each creature in the area takes @Damage[3d8[void]] damage with a basic Will save.</p><p>The flames feed: <strong>for each creature that fails its save, you regain 3 Hit Points</strong>, to a maximum equal to your level per casting.</p><p>A creature reduced to 0 Hit Points by this Technique has its soul consumed and cannot be raised by any effect below <em>resurrect</em>.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8 and the healing per failure by 2.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
